{
  "bookId": "hero-212107",
  "id": "bond-26063",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26063001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "死亡主宰在一堆花瓶碎片旁边发抖。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26063002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "发生什么事了？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26063003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "死亡主宰",
          "text": "好恶心......好可怕......不要过来！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "26063005",
              "text": "清扫碎片"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "26063004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26063005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "碎片下面扣着一本杂志。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "26063007",
              "text": "捡起杂志"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "26063006",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26063007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "杂志下面是死亡主宰的摩托车。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "26063009",
              "text": "查看摩托车"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "26063008",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26063009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "车底有一只被压扁的虫子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26063010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "死亡主宰",
          "text": "噫！快扔掉它，不要拿到我面前！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "26063012",
              "text": "扔掉虫子"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "26063011",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26063012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "死亡主宰",
          "text": "呼——因为体型变小，视野中的虫子成了庞然大物。\n我可能，稍微有点反应过度。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "26063014",
              "text": "没关系。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "26063015",
              "text": "确实反应过度了。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "26063013",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26063014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没关系，请安心吧，我会想些彻底驱虫的办法。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26063015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你可以不用勉强自己处理的，下次直接叫我过来就好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
